{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-03/1065425/block/singleImage/3276454/wm/01KMJM5MZHE7XEA3BXC68D42CN.jpg?updatedAt=1795504190\"/><figcaption>消息指中電明年會加電費1.8%，港燈則加7.9%。</figcaption></figure><p>中電及港燈今午將到立法會環境事務委員會交代周年電費檢討，消息指中電明年會加電費1.8%，港燈則加7.9%。 國際燃料價格大幅上升 據悉，兩電是次加電費主要因應國際燃料價格變動、推動減碳及發展潔淨能源基建的資本開支等。受國際油價波動影響，中電及港燈的燃料調整費較今年初升超過20%及55%。中電燃料費由1月的每度電39.4仙，升到本月的47.4仙。港燈燃料費則由1月份的每度電35.4仙，升至本月的55.1仙。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.930651+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:09:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:37:17.123563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:37:17.960457+00:00","content_hash":"f5091784dec510d8f659b2813bf7f99feae90a24bd4277b8022d5323ecf5a083","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.930651+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}